<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  «Приём подписки» (TvReceiveActivity) — handoff README §7, «Единое лекало».
  ============================================================================

      кнопка назад → «Приём подписки» 24sp/700 → пояснение 13sp
      → карточка с кодом сопряжения и состоянием
      → «Показать новый код»

  This is the second half of the TV transfer (П-06): the TV shows a pairing QR and
  listens on the LAN, the phone scans it and POSTs the subscription. It is opened
  from «Устройства» in the settings tab, so it is a sub-page like any other and it
  takes the same header — the screen used to draw a 16sp MaterialToolbar title from
  activity_base and a centred 18sp paragraph of its own.

  WHAT MOVED WHERE, and nothing was dropped: the instruction paragraph is
  @id/toolbar_note, which is exactly the slot §7 reserves for one sentence of
  explanation; @id/tv_status keeps its name and its four states (countdown, success,
  duplicate, expired, no network, failure) and gains accessibilityLiveRegion, so the
  countdown and the outcome are announced instead of only drawn; @id/iv_qrcode and
  @id/btn_regenerate keep their names and their visibility contract.

  TWO THINGS ARE DELIBERATELY NOT THE ROW GRAMMAR HERE.

  · THE QR KEEPS ITS WHITE PLATE. Every other hardcoded colour in the tree is a
    defect; this one is the scanner's contrast requirement, and it does not follow
    the theme in either direction — a QR on #141619 does not decode. It sits on a
    plate with the tile radius so it reads as an object on the card rather than a
    hole in it.

  · «Показать новый код» IS A BUTTON, NOT A ROW. This screen is driven by a D-pad
    from across a room: TvReceiveActivity calls requestFocus() on it in all four
    terminal states, and a Primary button carries a focus ring a row does not. The
    row grammar assumes a finger.

  OVERSCAN: TVs crop the edges of the panel. The content keeps ~5% of horizontal
  and vertical padding on top of the screen gutter, which is what the old file's
  48/27dp was doing.
-->
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto"
    xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:background="?android:attr/colorBackground"
    android:fitsSystemWindows="true"
    android:orientation="vertical"
    tools:context=".tv.TvReceiveActivity">

    <include
        android:id="@+id/toolbar"
        layout="@layout/view_sub_header" />

    <androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView
        android:id="@+id/main_content"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="0dp"
        android:layout_weight="1"
        android:clipToPadding="false"
        android:paddingStart="@dimen/tv_overscan_horizontal"
        android:paddingEnd="@dimen/tv_overscan_horizontal"
        android:paddingBottom="@dimen/tv_overscan_vertical"
        android:scrollbars="none">

        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:orientation="vertical">

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                style="@style/Widget.Departament.CardSection"
                android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/screen_gutter">

                <LinearLayout
                    style="@style/Widget.Departament.CardSection.Body"
                    android:gravity="center_horizontal"
                    android:paddingTop="@dimen/space_24"
                    android:paddingBottom="@dimen/space_24">

                    <!-- The white plate is the scanner's, not the theme's — see the note above.
                         Padding rather than a margin so the quiet zone the decoder needs is part
                         of the plate. -->
                    <ImageView
                        android:id="@+id/iv_qrcode"
                        android:layout_width="@dimen/tv_pairing_qr"
                        android:layout_height="@dimen/tv_pairing_qr"
                        android:background="@drawable/bg_qr_plate"
                        android:contentDescription="@string/tv_pairing_qr_desc"
                        android:padding="@dimen/space_12"
                        android:scaleType="fitCenter" />

                    <!-- Обратный отсчёт и итог. Одна живая область: телевизор читает её вслух,
                         когда счётчик доходит до конца или подписка приезжает. -->
                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/tv_status"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_20"
                        android:accessibilityLiveRegion="polite"
                        android:gravity="center"
                        android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Title"
                        tools:text="Ожидание телефона… 120 с" />

                    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
                        android:id="@+id/btn_regenerate"
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Button.Primary"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_20"
                        android:text="@string/tv_receive_regenerate"
                        android:visibility="gone"
                        tools:visibility="visible" />
                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>
        </LinearLayout>
    </androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView>
</LinearLayout>
